## mdeapp product constraints

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| **React maps** | `@vis.gl/react-google-maps` only — every `<Map>` has `mapId={getGoogleMapsMapId()}` |
| **Env (Next.js)** | `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID` in `mdeapp/.env.local` |
| **Places (server)** | `GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY` — never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` |
| **Field masks** | **Every** Places API (New) call includes `X-Goog-FieldMask` |
| **Medellín default** | `{ lat: 6.2442, lng: -75.5812 }` |
| **Avoid** | `react-wrapper`, legacy `loadGoogleMapsLibrary`, raw `google.maps.Map` in new code |

