## When to invoke Code Assist vs skill only

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Writing/editing map UI, Places tool, MAP task | MCP **retrieve-instructions** + **retrieve-google-maps-platform-docs** |
| mdeai-specific pins, MapContext, CopilotKit render | **mde-maps** skill references (no MCP required if already verified this session) |
| Live place search in prod chat | **Grounding Lite** or Supabase — **not** Code Assist |
